Paseo
https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo
Copyright (c) 2025-present Mohamed Boudra
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Portions of Crusteo are derived from Paseo: the conversation (agent timeline)
reducer in crates/fleet/src/timeline.rs, the tool-call display rules in
crates/fleet/src/display.rs, and the understanding of the daemon wire protocol
documented in docs/protocol/ and implemented in crates/paseo-client. These
were ported from Paseo's TypeScript sources to Rust and modified.

